      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation:\r\nEntrance Porch:               1.96 m x 1.78m  \r\nKitchen / Dining Area:     8.54 00 m x 4.15 m - Tiled floor, light oak timber kitchen, bowl and a half stainless steel sink, electric hob, & oven, dishwasher,  integrated fridge freezer, door to utility room Sea views, feature bay window 3m x 0.95m.\r\n\r\nUtility Room:                      1.35 M x 2.47 M - Tiled floor, washer/dryer, units to match kitchen, ample storage, Firebird oil boiler.\r\nW.C. :                                   1.44 M X 1.12 M\r\nBedroom 1:                        3.67 M  X 3.85 M  - Solid Oak flooring, Double Bed, & Ensuite with Electric Shower :- 1.18 M   X  2.44 \r\nLounge :                              4.45 M  X 3.81 M - Solid Oak Flooring, Open fireplace with cast iron mantle place, large Bay window with sea views, leading directedly into:-\r\nSunroom/Conservatory:  3.53M x 4.09M - Solid Oak  floor, patio doors to rear tarmac patio area with picnic bench. \r\n\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\nLanding Area:                      5.76 M X 1.98M - Carpeted, ith window overlooking the Bay.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom:                4.33 M X  3.37M - Walk in wardrobe, 1.42 M  X  1.10 M,  en-suite 1.07 M  X  2.56 M, Solic oak floor\r\nBedroom 3:                          3.61 M X   3.59 M - En-suite 1.98 2.45 M, Solic Oak floor\r\nBedroom 4:                          3.56 M X  3.72 M - En-suite  1.17 M X 2.43 M fully tiled.\r\nSpare Bedroom/Sitting Room:- 4.62 M   X 4.06 - Solid oak floor with view of Ballinskelligs Bay from large front facing window."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "This large detached 4 bedroom property is situated just 1.1km from Waterville Village, and also just 1Km from Waterville beach and Golf Links close to  to all amenities. The Property is in excellent decorative order throughout and offering spacious and bright accommodation. The Entrance way just off the Cliff Road in Waterville is wide and provides clear sight in both directions. The property extends to 207.92 sq. meters, and is built on a large site of C..33ha / C. .815 of an acre. The house is well laid out with the Kitchen/Dining area to the right of the Entrance hall, with a utility to the side of the Kitchen/Dining area. To the left of the entrance Hallway is the Lounge and the interlocking Conservatory just off this. There are sea views from both the lounge and Conservatory, with a small tarmac patio to the rear of the conservatory. The ground floor also has the convenience of a w.c. just off the Entrance hallway also. The ground floor is completed by an ensuite bedroom to the rear of the property.\r\nThere is a spacious Landing on first floor with a large window facing the Bay and it is comprised of Three ensuite Bedrooms with the master also having a walk in wardrobe. A fourth room which is currently being used as a store room, can easily be adapted as an extra bedroom or first floor sitting room as it has excellent views over Ballinskelligs Bay.\r\nOutside the property boasts a large easily maintained garden laid mainly to lawn and access is through double entrance pillars over a limestone chip driveway.\r\nWaterville Golf Links 1.1km, Hogs Head Golf Club 2.8km, Waterville promenade 1.1km, Kerry Airport 68.9km and Killarney 59.5km.\r\nViewing Highly Recommended.\r\nBER C. BER No: 119552024."
      },
